P('5.3-05','State the voltage relation between parallel branches at the same two nodes.','Their potential differences are equal.',1,'One mark for equal voltage.')
P('5.2.4-02','Explain temperature control in an Ohm’s-law test.','The relation requires unchanged temperature. Heating can change resistance and the current-to-voltage ratio.',2,'One mark for condition; one for changed resistance consequence.')
